        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>First Impressions 1229/1/17 Decorative 17 Inch Ornate Door Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis very decorative 17 inch door pull with decorative rosettes is cast in solid brass and completed in your choice of 5 popular high quality finishes. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available in shorter version: <a href=\"/products/decorative-10-inch-ornate-pull-with-rosettes-fii-1229-10\"><b>10\" Ornate Door Pull</b></a>.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for First Impressions 1229/1/17  Decorative Door Pull\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 16-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Center to Center: 14\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Max Diameter: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rosette Diameter: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Available in 5 Finishes</li>\r\n<li>Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Mounting Hardware:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Thru-Bolted Mounting:</b> Pull bolts through the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Surface Mounting:</b> Pull screws to the face of the door.</li>\r\n<li><b>Back-to-Back Mounting:</b> Pulls bolt to each other through the door. <b>Requires 2 pulls</b>.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold individually (1 door pull handle). If you order Back-to-Back Mounting please Order 2 Pulls.</i>\r\n</p>",
